      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- CAP: Availability > Consistency: for querying event information and search\n- CAP: Consistency > Availability: for booking tickets (must not double book tickets)\n- Low Latency for Search (<100ms ideal)\n- Read Heavy > Writes\n- System Preparation for Uber-Popular events that are heavily read from Hot Keys in\nour database/cache",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- CAP: Availability > Consistency: for querying event information and search\n- CAP: Consistency > Availability: for booking tickets (must not double book tickets)\n- Low Latency for Search (<100ms ideal)\n- Read Heavy > Writes\n- System Preparation for Uber-Popular events that are heavily read from Hot Keys in\nour database/cache",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 139,
      "index": "aC",
